  "prompt": "Cute minimalist impasto oil painting on rough white textured handmade paper. Center composition: thick palette knife pastel rainbow in blush pink, pale peach, warm coral orange, creamy white, and muted lavender with visible ridges. Beside it, a soft pink daisy with pastel petals, dark yellow brown center, and olive green leaves in thick impasto. Above, a glowing yellow sun with uneven thick strokes and short rounded rays over a soft pastel square blending baby pink and pale lavender. Small pastel butterflies and white cloud doodles with dimensional texture and soft shadows. Below the rainbow, handwritten black \"have a nice day\" in messy childlike lettering. Warm diagonal sunlight glow, soft golden lighting, cozy pastel aesthetic, handcrafted tactile texture, realistic paper grain, ultra detailed, 4K. --chaos 20 --ar 9:16 --raw --sref 2107971226 4215070372 1057067396 1339491431 939717910 2845739466 --v 8.1",
